      "writtenOn": "2024-11-20T16:54:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In other words, this comment should read more like \"PartitionAlloc (and possibly other projects) isn\u0027t written in C or C++ but in a dialect that assumes pointers of different types (other than `char` or `unsigned char`) may freely point to the same locations in memory.\"",
